<title>UK: Fannie Mae prices $500 mln 5yr bond, +38bp.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae prices $500 mln 5yr bond, +38bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Goldman Sachs and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FEDERAL NATIONAL MORTGAGE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     6.35	MATURITY    23.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.966    PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    99.966    SPREAD	+38BP</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AT PAR AFTER YEAR THREE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND W/I FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY  </p>
<p> TOTAL FEES    25 BP     MAN/UND    5 BP     SELLING   20 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K)    10	  FORCE MAJ  YES	CROSS DFT NO</p>
<p> NEG PLEDGE    NO	  LISTING    LUX	GOV LAW   NEW YORK</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
